UPDATE companies SET description='Blue Frog Foods operates as a contract food manufacturer in Austell, Georgia. The business traces its roots to Chef Michael Deihl, who founded The Michael Deihl Group, LLC after identifying a need for high-quality culinary professionalism in the food and beverage sector. His background includes managing kitchens at country clubs, hotels, and restaurants along the eastern seaboard, as well as developing products for international distribution.

The company provides co-packing, research and development, private label manufacturing, and consulting services. Its team of qualified chefs focuses on flavor profiling, menu and recipe development, staff training, and food styling. Production emphasizes artisan, handcrafted methods scaled for commercial volumes, using locally sourced ingredients to create distinctive, healthy, and affordable food products.

Blue Frog Foods serves food brands, chefs, and businesses seeking to commercialize products. Its co-packing and private label services support clients from concept through production, while consulting covers supply considerations such as case corrugate, packaging, labels, and nutritional panels. The company positions itself as a partner for busy culinary professionals and emerging food brands.

The founder’s original vision was to fuse the values of homemade dishes with locally sourced ingredients and diverse cooking styles. The company says its differentiator lies in an artisan aura inspired by ethnic, local, and regional cuisines, delivered by chefs passionate about quality food and customer satisfaction.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Co-packing", "Research and development", "Private label manufacturing", "Consulting", "Flavor profiling", "Menu development", "Recipe development", "Staff training", "Food styling", "Supply chain coordination"], "industries": ["Food and beverage", "Food manufacturing", "Co-packing", "Private label food", "Culinary services"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Artisan, handcrafted methods scaled for commercial production", "Locally sourced ingredients fused with homemade dish values", "Team of highly qualified chefs with culinary expertise", "Comprehensive services from R&D through co-packing and consulting", "Focus on affordable, healthy, and distinctive food products"], "facts_used": ["Location: Austell, Georgia -> /", "Services: co-packing, R&D, private label, consulting -> /", "Founder: Chef Michael Deihl founded The Michael Deihl Group, LLC -> db", "Mission: create high quality affordable food products fusing homemade values with locally-sourced ingredients -> /", "Team: highly qualified chefs, artisan handcrafted to scale -> /", "Target customers: busy chefs, food brands -> /", "Supply considerations: case corrugate, packaging, labels, nutritional panels -> db"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Blue Frog Foods is a contract food manufacturer located in Austell, Georgia, providing co-packing, research and development, private label manufacturing, and consulting.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "