' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Bon Homme Yankton Electric Association, Inc. is a member-owned electric cooperative headquartered in Tabor, South Dakota. For more than 80 years, the cooperative has delivered electricity to rural farms, homes, and businesses across Bon Homme and Yankton counties, including the town of Tabor. It operates as a Touchstone Energy Cooperative, part of a national network of member-focused utilities.

The cooperative distributes electric power to approximately 3,800 consumer-members, spanning agricultural, residential, and commercial accounts. Beyond basic distribution, it runs energy efficiency programs, load management initiatives, and rebate incentives for agricultural and commercial equipment. It also manages a distributed energy resource interconnection process for member-owned solar installations, offers safety education covering farm hazards, power lines, and emergency preparedness, and maintains an electrical department for service connections and security lighting.

Its members include family farms, rural households, and local businesses in southeast South Dakota. The cooperative supports the region through a revolving economic development fund, a community grant program funded by member bill rounding, and a discount card network. Youth engagement comes via scholarships, an annual youth tour to Washington, D.C., and a scholar-of-the-week recognition program.

The cooperative states its mission is to provide safe, reliable electric energy and other services to its member-consumers, guided by principles of innovation, accountability, integrity, and commitment to service. Capital credits are returned to members when financial conditions allow, reinforcing the not-for-profit, member-owned structure.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electric power distribution", "Energy efficiency consulting", "Load management", "Agricultural and commercial rebate programs", "Renewable energy certificate (REC) program", "Distributed energy resource interconnection", "Solar interconnection processing", "Electrical service connections", "Security lighting installation and maintenance", "Farm safety education", "Power line safety education", "Emergency preparedness training", "Generator safety education", "Tree trimming safety education", "Youth scholarship programs", "Youth tour and excursion programs", "Community economic development funding (REED Fund)", "Member bill rounding for community grants (Operation Round Up)", "Co-op Connections member discount program", "Capital credit allocation and retirement", "Board governance and member bylaws administration", "Annual member meeting coordination", "Touchstone Energy Scholar of the Week program", "Employment and workforce development"], "industries": ["Agriculture", "Residential", "Commercial"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Member-owned cooperative returning capital credits to consumers", "Touchstone Energy Cooperative affiliation providing national resources", "Comprehensive energy efficiency, rebate, and load management programs", "Distributed energy resource interconnection process for member solar", "Community investment through REED Fund, Operation Round Up, and youth scholarships"], "facts_used": ["Provides electric power to over 3,800 consumer-members -> /", "Headquartered in Tabor, South Dakota -> /", "Serves Bon Homme and Yankton counties -> /", "More than 80 years delivering energy -> /", "Mission: provide safe, reliable electric energy and other services -> /", "Offers energy efficiency, rebates, load management, distributed energy interconnection -> /", "Operates youth programs, scholarships, community funds (REED Fund, Operation Round Up) -> /", "Touchstone Energy Cooperative affiliation -> /", "Member-owned cooperative structure with capital credits -> /", "Electrical department for service connections and security lighting -> /"], "company_type": "Other", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Bon Homme Yankton Electric Association, Inc. is a Touchstone Energy Cooperative that provides electric power to over 3,800 farm, residential, and commercial consumer-members in southeast South Dakota.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='bon-homme-yankton-electric-association-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Bourgault Industries is based in Minot, North Dakota, where it manufactures modern agricultural machinery and equipment. The company does not publicly disclose its founding year, ownership structure, or founder names.

The company produces a broad range of precision seeding, air seeding, and tillage systems. Its product portfolio includes air carts, hoe drills, coulter drills, frame-mounted seeders, mid-row applicators, air planters, air hoe drills, cultivators, harrows, wing-type packers, liquid fertilizer carts, and grain carts. Specific model lines such as the 9000 I Series Air Carts, 3820 ParaLink™ Coulter Drill, and SPS365 Soil Prep System™ illustrate the depth of its offering. No facility size, headcount, or annual volume figures are provided.

Bourgault serves farmers and agricultural operations seeking to maximize efficiency and optimize yields.

