UPDATE companies SET description='C & M Hydraulics, Inc. has operated from North Las Vegas, Nevada since its founding in 1994. The company began as a specialist in rebuilding hydraulic components for Mercedes-Benz vehicles, focusing on power steering gearboxes, pumps, and suspension systems, and now covers a range of hydraulic units including ABC pumps.

