UPDATE companies SET description='Cadrex Chaska, formerly Richlind Metal Fabricators, operates in Chaska, Minnesota. The business was established in 1963 as Richlind Metal Fabricators and was acquired by Cadrex in January 2022, transitioning to the Cadrex brand by August 2022.

The facility provides precision fabrication of finished components and complex assemblies, offering sheet metal fabrication, stamping, CNC machining, welding, plastic injection molding, mechanical assembly, painting and finishing, and system integration and testing. As part of Cadrex, the site draws on a network of 20 facilities totaling 1.5 million square feet and more than 600 machines across the U.S. and Mexico, with capabilities spanning concept development, prototyping, tool design, and custom automation.

The company serves aerospace and defense, medical, data center infrastructure, information communication technology, warehouse automation and robotics, kiosk and gaming, renewable energy and electrical infrastructure, semiconductor equipment, and general commercial industries. Customers include firms such as BAE Systems, referenced in supplier awards.

Richlind was founded on a commitment to engineering support and prototype-to-production processing using shearing, sawing, laser cutting, turning, forming, and machining. Under Cadrex, the operation emphasizes a broad capability set and specialized sector experience to move customer programs from concept to scale quickly.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 13485']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Sheet metal fabrication", "Sheet metal stamping", "Precision CNC machining", "Welding", "Plastic injection molding", "Mechanical assembly", "Painting and finishing", "System integration and testing", "Supply chain management", "Concept development", "Dedicated prototyping center", "Design for manufacturability (DFM)", "Tool design and build", "Custom automation programs", "Engineering support", "Shearing", "Sawing", "Laser cutting", "Turning", "Forming"], "industries": ["Aerospace & defense", "Medical", "Data center infrastructure", "Information communication technology", "Warehouse automation & robotics", "Kiosk & gaming", "Renewable energy & electrical infrastructure", "Semiconductor equipment manufacturing", "Commercial industries"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 50 years of progressive technology in metals and plastic fabrication", "Engineering support and prototype-to-production processing", "Part of a 20-facility, 1.5M sq ft North American manufacturing network", "600+ machines including fully automated equipment and robots", "10 unique certifications across the organization"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1963 -> /", "Located in Chaska, Minnesota -> /", "Acquired by Cadrex January 2022 -> /", "Services: engineering support, prototype-to-production processing utilizing shearing, sawing, laser cutting, turning, forming, machining -> /", "Industries: Aerospace, defense, commercial -> /", "Cadrex has 20 facilities across 9 states and Mexico -> /about-us", "1.5M square feet capacity -> /about-us", "600+ machi