Customers come from the automotive and medical sectors, as well as hospitals and software companies. The firm says it helps these clients reduce cable costs by tailoring designs to exact requirements rather than relying on off‑the‑shelf products.

California Custom Cable states that its differentiation lies in personalized attention from knowledgeable staff, rigorous material selection, and a focus on delivering resilient, safe products for homes, businesses, and industrial environments. The company also highlights its friendly, professional team that works closely with customers to discuss service needs.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom wire and cable manufacturing", "Medical cable assembly", "Automotive cable assembly"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Medical", "Healthcare", "Software"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom cable manufacturing to exact specifications", "Medical and automotive cable expertise", "Quality checks on all products using high-grade materials", "Cost reduction through tailored designs", "Personalized service from experienced staff"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2005 -> db", "Headquarters in Gardena, California -> db, /", "21 years of experience in wire and cable manufacturing -> /", "Specializes in custom wire and cable specifications -> /", "Produces medical cables and automotive cables -> /, industries_served", "Serves hospitals and software companies -> /", "Uses finest materials and stringent quality checks -> /", "Helps clients cut cable costs -> /", "Offers personalized attention from knowledgeable staff -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "21 years of experience in the wire and cable manufacturing business.", "founded_year": "2005", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='california-custom-cable' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='California Fine Wire Co. was founded in June 1961 by Michael A. Greenelsh in Grover Beach, California. Starting with a single wire drawing machine, the company has grown into a multi‑million‑dollar operation supplying specialty wire and ribbon worldwide.

The company manufactures fine and ultra‑fine wire in round and flat profiles, with diameters from 0.0004″ to 0.125″. Core processes include wire drawing, enamel insulation coating (ceramic, PTFE, nylon, polyester), PTFE insulation, electroplating, flat‑ribbon production, annealing, stranding, cutting, straightening, grinding, polishing, and custom spooling. CFW operates 25 enamel coating machines and maintains an in‑house testing laboratory capable of dimensional measurement to 0.00001″ resolution (±0.00005″ accuracy), tensile testing, and resistance measurement.

Founder Michael A. Greenelsh emphasized that the company’s real specialty is fulfilling customers’ specific needs, no matter how small or unusual. This philosophy, combined with ISO 9001‑certified quality systems and decades‑experienced staff, underpins CFW’s focus on custom solutions for demanding environments.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ITAR','ROHS']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wire drawing (round and flat profiles)", "Enamel insulation coating (ceramic, PTFE, nylon, polyester)", "PTFE insulation", "Electroplating", "Flat ribbon wire production", "Annealing", "Stranding and twisting", "Cutting and stripping", "Straightening", "Grinding and polishing", "Ultra finish surface treatment", "Custom spooling and packaging", "Testing (dimensional, tensile, resistance, metallographic)", "Composite-clad wire manufacturing", "Thermocouple wire manufacturing", "Bifilar/duplex wire construction"], "industries": ["Medical devices", "Aerospace", "Defense", "Electronics", "Semiconductor", "Industrial", "Research", "Marine", "Chemical processing"], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Composite-clad metals", "Copper and copper alloys", "Gold (99.99%)", "Nickel and nickel alloys", "Platinum (99.99%)", "Refractory metals", "Stainless steel (multiple grades)", "Thermocouple alloys", "Resistance alloys", "Potentiometer alloys", "Low thermal expansion (glass sealing) alloys", "Precious metals"], "equipment": ["25 enamel coating machines", "Dimensional measurement instruments (0.00001\" resolution)", "Tensile testing machines", "Resistance measurement equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "\u00b10.00005 in dimensional accuracy", "built_on": ["Over 60 years of experience in ultra\u2011fine wire manufacturing (since 1961)", "ISO 9001 certified quality system with in\u2011house testing lab (dimensional resolution 0.00001\")", "25 enamel coating machines for insulating coatings", "Wire supplied to aerospace missions including lunar programs", "Capability to draw w