UPDATE companies SET description='Care Medical operates from Gainesville, Georgia, as a locally focused home medical equipment provider with a staff of over 45 employees. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure, but it describes itself as a community-oriented business that partners with customers and referral sources to deliver quality care.

The company supplies a range of respiratory and mobility equipment, including invasive and non‑invasive ventilators, oxygen systems, complex power wheelchairs with custom seating and alternative drive options, and a broad catalog of daily‑living aids such as walking aids, bathroom safety products, and seat‑lift chairs. It also runs a home sleep‑testing program for sleep‑apnea patients, with results reviewed by board‑certified sleep physicians, and provides CPAP/BiPAP therapy setup. Services are supported by a team of respiratory therapists and certified Assistive Technology Professionals (ATPs) who guide patients from evaluation through delivery and follow‑up.

Care Medical serves ventilator‑dependent patients, individuals with COPD, those requiring complex rehab mobility equipment, and sleep‑apnea sufferers. The company works with insurers to secure funding for complex rehab equipment and coordinates with physicians for prescription‑based therapies.

The firm emphasizes responsive, compassionate care and quick decision‑making, citing community involvement through financial contributions to local charities, equipment donations to indigent patients, and staff participation on non‑profit boards. Its stated differentiator is a hands‑on approach where ATPs and respiratory therapists remain engaged throughout the equipment lifecycle, aiming to reduce hospital readmissions and improve patient independence.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Invasive ventilator therapy", "Non-invasive ventilator therapy", "Oxygen therapy equipment provision", "Complex power wheelchair evaluation and fitting", "Seating and positioning assessment", "Alternative drive system configuration", "Daily living aids provision", "Home sleep apnea testing", "CPAP/BiPAP therapy setup", "Respiratory therapy services", "Certified ATP consultation", "Board-certified sleep physician review"], "industries": ["Home medical equipment", "Ventilator therapy", "Oxygen therapy", "Complex rehabilitation technology", "Daily living aids", "Sleep apnea treatment"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Responsive and compassionate care with quick decision-making", "Community involvement including financial contributions to local charities and equipment for indigent patients", "Certified ATPs guide patients from evaluation through delivery and follow-up", "Home sleep testing system reviewed by board-certified sleep physicians", "Team of respiratory therapists focused on reducing hospital readmissions"], "facts_used": ["Location: Gainesville, Georgia -> db", "Employee count: 45 -> db", "Employee count: over 45 -> /", "Services: ventilator therapy (invasive/non-invasive) -> /services", "Services: oxygen equipment -> /services", "Services: mobility equipment (complex power wheelchairs) -> /services", "Services: medical supplies (daily living aids) -> /services", "Services: CPAP/sleep apnea equipment and home sleep testing -> /services", "Staff: respiratory therapists -> /services", "Staff: certified ATPs -> /services", "Staff: board-certified sleep doctors -> /services", "Community involvement: financial contributions to local charities, equipment for indigent patients, non-profit board service -> /", "Differentiator: responsive and compassionate care, quick decisions -> /", "Differentiator: ATPs partner from evaluation through delivery -> /services", "Differentiator: home sleep testing system reviewed by board-certified sleep physicians -> /services", "Industries served: home medical equipment, ventilator therapy, oxygen therapy, complex rehab, daily living aids, sleep apnea -> /services", "Customer types: ventilator-dependent patients, COPD patients, mobility-impaired patients, sleep apnea patients, Medicare beneficiaries, referral sources -> /services", "Insurance: Medicare, most insurances -> /services"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Care Medical is a local home medical equipment company dedicated to partnering with our customers and referral sources to provide the best quality of care.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "45", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='care-medical' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='CareLinc Medical Equipment & Supply operates a location in Grand Haven, Michigan, at 1015 S. Beacon Boulevard. The company serves as a home medical equipment provider, offering sales and rentals of a broad range of products for long-term care, hospice, and home accessibility needs.

The Grand Haven store supplies equipment across categories including aids to daily living, bathroom safety products, breast pumps, CPAP and BiPAP machines and supplies, diabetic supplies, hospital beds, lift chairs, medical supplies, oxygen supplies, ventilators, wheelchairs, walkers, and wound management products. The facility provides both retail sales and rental programs, supported by a trained staff that assists customers with product selection and insurance qualification, such as for free breast pumps through insurance.

CareLinc highlights its 24/7 emergency on-call service as a key differentiator, ensuring support outside regular business hours. The team prioritizes finding optimal solutions for each customer’s individual medical equipment needs, and offers a virtual tour of the Grand Haven location for remote assessment.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["24/7 emergency on-call service", "Medical equipment sales", "Medical equipment rentals", "Breast pump insurance qualification assistance", "Home accessibility assessment", "Long-term care equipment provision", "Hospice care equipment provision", "CPAP/BiPAP equipment supply", "Oxygen equipment supply", "Wound management product supply", "Wheelchair and walker provision", "Hospital bed and lift chair provision"], "industries": ["Home healthcare", "Long-term care", "Hospice care", "Durable medical equipment (DME) supply", "Home accessibility"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24/7 emergency on-call service", "Sales and rentals of home medical equipment", "Insurance qualification assistance for breast pumps", "Virtual tour of facility available", "Trained staff for product selection and home accessibility solutions"], "facts_used": ["Location: Grand Haven, MI at 1015 S. Beacon Blvd. -> /", "Phone: , Fax:  -> /", "Hours: Mon-Fri 8am-5pm, Sat-Sun closed -> /", "Description: home medical equipment provider with sales and rentals -> /", "Product categories: aids to daily living, bathroom safety, breast pumps, CPAP/BiPAP, diabetic supplies, hospital beds, lift chairs, medical supplies, oxygen supplies, ventilators, wheelchairs, walkers, wound management -> /", "24/7 Emergency On-Call Service Available -> /", "Single or double pump capability -> db", "Breast pump qualification assistance -> /", "Virtual tour available -> /", "Years of expertise in long-term and hospice care, home accessibility -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "mak