UPDATE companies SET description='Cargill’s newest protein processing facility sits in North Kingstown, Rhode Island, a coastal community of roughly 27,800 residents in Washington County. The plant represents a strategic investment of more than $120 million and is one of the company’s most advanced slicing and packaging operations.

The 200,000-square-foot facility specializes in fresh beef, ground beef, pork, and value‑added meat products. It operates as a slicing and packaging plant, part of Cargill’s North American food business that employs 28,000 people across approximately 60 processing facilities, distribution centers, feed mills, hatcheries, and an innovation center in the U.S. and Canada.

The plant’s output is directed at retail and foodservice partners throughout the Northeast and beyond.

Cargill states that the facility was built to strengthen its commitment to innovation, food safety, and regional economic development. The company’s broader purpose is to nourish the world in a safe, responsible, and sustainable way, and the North Kingstown plant is positioned as a key asset in meeting that goal for the Northeast market.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Meat slicing", "Meat packaging", "Fresh beef processing", "Ground beef production", "Pork processing", "Value-added meat product manufacturing"], "industries": ["Retail", "Foodservice", "Food processing", "Agriculture", "Financial services", "Industrial"], "materials": ["Beef", "Pork"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Strategic investment of over $120 million in a state-of-the-art slicing and packaging plant", "Strengthens commitment to innovation, food safety, and regional economic development", "Enhances ability to deliver high-quality protein solutions to retail and foodservice partners across the Northeast", "Part of a global network with 155,000 colleagues operating in 70 countries"], "facts_used": ["Location: North Kingstown, Rhode Island, Washington County -> /", "Facility size: 200,000 square feet -> /", "Investment: over $120 million -> /", "Products: fresh beef, ground beef, pork, value-added meat products -> /", "Global colleagues: 155,000 in 70 countries -> /about-us", "North American team: 28,000 across ~60 facilities -> /", "Purpose: nourish the world in a safe, responsible, sustainable way -> /about-us", "Facility focus: innovation, food safety, regional economic development -> /", "Customers: retail and foodservice partners across the Northeast -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "this state-of-the-art slicing and packaging plant specializes in the production of fresh beef, ground beef, pork, and value-added meat products", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": ""