UPDATE companies SET description='Carolina Creative Products operates from Greenville, South Carolina, as a U.S.-based manufacturer of premium home soft goods. The company specializes in pillows, bedding, and fabric-based home products, serving branded home and lifestyle companies that need reliable domestic production without building their own infrastructure.

