UPDATE companies SET description='Carolina Custom Sawing & Lumber began operating in 2017 in Rougemont, North Carolina, a community in northern Durham County near the Orange and Person county lines. The sawmill serves the greater Triangle area, including Durham, Hillsborough, Chapel Hill, Roxboro, and Raleigh, and travels throughout North Carolina and parts of Virginia to provide mobile sawmilling services.

The company operates a mobile hydraulic bandsaw sawmill capable of processing logs up to 21 feet long and 32 inches in diameter, with a 26-inch throat capacity. It offers both mobile sawmilling at the customer''s site and stationary milling at its own yard, producing dimensional boards, live-edge slabs, and specialty cuts such as quartersawn, riftsawn, plainsawn, and livesawn lumber. The sawmill supplies green, air-dried, and kiln-dried lumber in a range of domestic hardwoods and softwoods, and also fabricates blocking and cribbing for heavy equipment transport and repair.

Customers span residential construction, commercial construction, industrial construction, manufacturing, woodworking, furniture production, agricultural projects, and heavy equipment repair. The company fulfills custom orders for beams, trailer decking, post-and-beam construction, mantles, tables, benches, spacers, and other industrial wood components. It also purchases logs meeting minimum size requirements for its own inventory.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Mobile sawmilling", "Stationary milling", "Lumber sales (green, air-dried, kiln-dried)", "Custom sawing (dimensional boards, live-edge slabs)", "Quartersawn, riftsawn, plainsawn, livesawn/through-and-through cutting", "Blocking and cribbing production", "Log purchasing", "Custom cutting up to 26\" wide and 21'' long"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Industrial construction", "Manufacturing", "Industrial processes", "Woodworking", "Furniture production", "Heavy equipment transportation and repair", "Agricultural", "Trailer decking", "Post and beam construction"], "materials": ["Black Walnut", "Cherry", "Red Maple", "White Oak", "Red Oak", "Hickory", "Sycamore", "Ash", "Birch", "Beech", "Cedar", "Cypress", "Southern Yellow Pine", "Elm"], "equipment": ["Mobile hydraulic bandsaw sawmill"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Mobile sawmill services throughout North Carolina and parts of Virginia", "Hydraulic bandsaw sawmill handles logs up to 21'' long and 32\" diameter", "No minimum charge for stationary milling at their yard", "Customers can assist with loading/offloading to reduce costs", "Sells green, air-dried, and kiln-dried lumber in multiple species"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2017 -> db", "Headquarters Rougemont, North Carolina -> db", "Mobile hydraulic bandsaw sawmill -> home page", "Services: mobile sawmilling, stationary milling, lumber sales, custom orders -> services page", "Log capacity: up to 21'' lon