UPDATE companies SET description='Champlain Cable Corporation has operated from Plattsburgh, New York since its founding in 1946. Over more than seven decades, it has grown into a specialist in high-performance wire and cable for demanding environments.

The company designs and manufactures copper and aluminum wire, tubing, and custom cable assemblies. Core processes include electron beam cross-linking, custom polymer compound development, advanced insulation systems, and collaborative design engineering. Champlain Cable maintains in-house irradiation treatment, testing, and research facilities, supported by a workforce of 50 to 199 employees. Product lines span building wire, refrigerant tubing, and branded solutions such as EXAR, EXRAD, DATACLEAR, and DATARAD.

Champlain Cable serves a diverse industrial base including automotive, aerospace, military, rail, truck and bus, industrial, marine, agricultural, mining, construction, and umbilicals markets. The company also supplies HVAC, plumbing, and electrical construction sectors. Notable customers include the U.S. Navy, for which it developed the DATACLEAR family of rugged, low-smoke data cables, and North American rail transit operators through a distribution partnership with Cameron Connect.

Champlain Cable emphasizes its leadership in irradiated cross-linked technology and polymer science, citing continuous investment in manufacturing innovation. The company states that its differentiators are custom product innovation, cutting-edge polymer science, in-house irradiation treatments, and rigorous testing and process controls, all aimed at delivering superior durability, flexibility, and thermal resistance for mission-critical applications.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electron beam cross-linking", "Custom polymer compound development", "Advanced insulation systems", "Custom design and engineering", "Testing and quality assurance", "Research and development", "Custom product innovation", "Polymer science", "In-house irradiation treatments"], "industries": ["Agricultural", "Mining", "Construction", "Automotive", "Truck & Bus", "Rail", "Industrial", "Military", "Umbilicals", "Custom Cables", "Aerospace", "Marine", "HVAC", "Plumbing", "Electrical"], "materials": ["Copper", "Aluminum", "Cross-linked polymers", "Custom polymer compounds"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house electron beam cross-linking for enhanced material properties", "Custom polymer compound development for durability and thermal performance", "Proprietary irradiation technology under EXAR and EXRAD brands", "Collaborative custom design and engineering", "Rigorous testing and process controls"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1946 -> db", "Headquarters Plattsburgh, New York -> db", "Employee count 50-199 -> db", "Manufactures copper and aluminum wire and tubing -> db", "Electron beam cross-linking capability -> /, /capabilities", "Custom polymer compound development -> /, /capabilities", "Advanced insulation systems -> /", "Custom design & engineering -> /", "Testing & quality assurance -> /, /capabilities", "Research & development -> /capabilities", "Brands: EXAR, EXRAD, EXRAD Rail, DATACLEAR, DATARAD -> /", "U.