UPDATE companies SET description='Chaucer Foods is headquartered in Forest Grove, Oregon. The company traces its roots to a bakery established in Kent, United Kingdom, though the exact founding year is not disclosed.

The company manufactures freeze-dried and baked ingredients for the food and beverage industry. Its core processes include freeze-drying and baking, supported by proprietary supply chain tracking software and direct farmer engagement through agronomists. Chaucer operates manufacturing and development facilities in the United States, the United Kingdom, Europe, and China, providing global production capacity.

Chaucer supplies major retail and foodservice brands worldwide. Its ingredients are used in beverage, confectionery, bakery, and foodservice applications. The company works with customers to develop custom formulations and recipes, leveraging research and applications teams.

